{"material_id": "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2023a.q20.material.recovered", "text": "阅读下列材料，并回答问题。材料：下面某教师在《文艺复兴》这节课介绍达芬奇的《最后的晚餐》时的教学片段：老师：谁知道这副画作的作者是谁？学生：达芬奇。教师：谁来分析一下《最后的晚餐》这副画作有什么特点。学生没有人举手回答。教师直接介绍：这幅画的特点是非常写实，达芬奇通过光影和透视的处理，让人物形象栩栩如生。教师展示13世纪的画作《最后的晚餐》，并提问：这个画作和达芬奇的《蒙娜丽莎》有什么不同？一位学生回答：老师，我觉得这副幅画的颜色没有达芬奇的《蒙娜丽莎》好看······", "source_files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "ffc468a8db0726130a886636eb59f28ea567253748542c024a38055c8072c3c3", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3387, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3624, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "question_raw", "locator": {"paper_order": 20, "alignment_status": "pending"}, "sha256": "ffc468a8db0726130a886636eb59f28ea567253748542c024a38055c8072c3c3"}], "review": {"content_verified": false, "status": "auto_parsed", "extraction_status": "source_interval_recovered_pending_expert"}, "question_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2023a.q20"], "knowledge_node_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s1.k07", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s4.k01", "ntce.chuzhong.lishi.s4.k03"], "ability_ids": ["ntce.chuzhong.ability.evaluate", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.manage", "ntce.chuzhong.ability.subject"], "exam_requirement_ids": ["ntce.outline.316.r017"], "used_by_questions": ["ntce.chuzhong.lishi.2023a.q20"], "word_count": 237, "level": "chuzhong", "subject": "lishi", "kind": "case_material", "source": {"origin_file": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "files": [{"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题（考生回忆版）.csv", "role": "material_raw", "sha256": "ffc468a8db0726130a886636eb59f28ea567253748542c024a38055c8072c3c3", "locator": {"decoded_csv_character_start": 3387, "decoded_csv_character_end": 3624, "next_source_question_number": 31, "alignment_status": "unique_task_excerpt_with_preceding_case_section"}}, {"path": "教资/真题/初中真题/2023年上半年教师资格证考试《初中历史》题（考生回忆版）.csv